semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 结论 denotes a deductive finding or verdict arrived at after systematic inquiry or logical argumentation.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 结论 vs. 结果 | jiéguǒ | 结论 is a rational intellectual judgment or deduction reached through analysis, whereas 结果 is the concrete physical or situational aftermath brought about by an event.
    2 | 结论 vs. 决定 | juédìng | 结论 is a cognitive finding about truth or reality (what is true), whereas 决定 is an executive choice or commitment to future action (what to do).
    3 | 结论 vs. 观点 | guāndiǎn | 结论 is the reasoned end-point of an investigation, while 观点 is an individual's ongoing perspective, stance, or viewpoint.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 在探求真理的道路上，得出科学的结论从来都不是轻而易举的事。真正的智者懂得在证据不足时克制断言的冲动，以谦逊严谨的态度面对复杂事物。经得起历史检验的真知灼见，往往孕育在长久的审慎与求证之中。 | Zài tànqiú zhēnlǐ de dàolù shàng, déchū kēxué de jiélùn cónglái dōu bùshì qīng'éryǐjǔ de shì. Zhēnzhèng de zhìzhě dǒngdé zài zhèngjù bùzú shí kèzhì duànyán de chōngdòng, yǐ qiānxùn yánjǐn de tàidù miànduì fùzá shìwù. Jīngdeqǐ lìshǐ jiǎnyàn de zhēnzhī-zhuójiàn, wǎngwǎng yùnyù zài chángjiǔ de shěnshèn yǔ qiúzhèng zhīzhōng. | On the path of seeking truth, arriving at scientific conclusions is never trivial. True sages restrain the impulse to assert when evidence is incomplete, facing complexity with humility. Insight that weathers time is nurtured in prolonged prudence. | En la búsqueda de la verdad, alcanzar una conclusión científica jamás es tarea baladí. El auténtico sabio contiene el impulso de juzgar cuando faltan pruebas y afronta lo complejo con mesura. Las ideas que superan la prueba del tiempo se forjan en la paciente verificación.
  #2 | 学术界关于历史事件的定论往往需要经历多代学者的反复考辨与实证补充。随着新出土文物的重见天日，以往看似无懈可击的历史结论有时会被修正，这恰恰展现了人文科学自我革新与无限逼近真相的严谨魅力。 | Xuéshùjiè guānyú lìshǐ shìjiàn de dìnglùn wǎngwǎng xūyào jīnglì duō dài xuézhě de fǎnfù kǎobiàn yǔ shízèng bǔchōng. Suízhe xīn chūtǔ wénwù de chóngjiàn-tiānrì, yǐwǎng kànsì wúxièkějī de lìshǐ jiélùn yǒushí huì bèi xiūzhèng, zhè qiàqià zhǎnxiàn le rénwén kēxué zìwǒ géxīn yǔ wúxiàn bījìn zhēnxiàng de yánjǐn mèilì. | Final academic verdicts on history demand generations of verification. As ununearthed artifacts see light, seemingly unassailable conclusions are revised, illustrating the rigorous charm of the humanities constantly drawing nearer to truth. | Los dictámenes historiográficos definitivos exigen generaciones de cotejo empírico. Al desenterrarse nuevos vestigios, conclusiones antaño incuestionables se revisan, revelando la admirable vocación de las humanidades de renovarse y aproximarse a la verdad objetiva.
